WEBVTT

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.580
Aika!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.080
Speak to me, Aika! Hey!

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.520
Hand the woman over!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.140
Shit! Reinforcements.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.800
Aika...

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.130
Idiot! What do you
think you're doing?

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.440
If you go out there, you'll
just end up getting caught, too.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.060
Just wait here
and see what happens.

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:29.610
I figured this would happen!

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:30.650
Bandra!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.340
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.680
Oh, well, they're gone.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:05.410
Don't just say "they're gone!"
What'll I do now?!

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.680
Good question.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:20.360
Everything about you is everything to me.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.440
I don't want to hold back anymore!

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:28.450
I remember. We got G.D.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.160
Let's follow the course where our curiosity leads...

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.080
...and I know a wondrous power will be born.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:39.170
Silent City. We're Salvagers.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.000
Let's go out sometime and try to find...

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.010
...the skyscrapers in the sunken cities below.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:49.590
Don't be afraid. Come together.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:54.930
As the sun shines down upon us...

00:02:55.770 --> 00:03:00.360
...now, let's try to recover...

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:05.440
...everything that's been lost!

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:11.570
Let's journey beyond time!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:19.040
I miss you! I want to take it to you!

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:22.340
I don't want you to forget about me.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:27.300
I take you! Because there is...

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:33.300
...a shining world that no one's ever seen!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.270
Let it go!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.440
Forever...

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.880
Well? You coming or not?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.410
Look, just close the
duct after me, okay?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.620
I'll go! l'll go!
l'll go with you!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.330
Aika, what on Earth are you...?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.670
Ultranate metal...

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.130
I take it she isn't naked 'cuz
you two were having fun, right?

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.180
Bandra, do you know
something about this?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.080
Oh, a little.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:55.310
Even with their lame-ass shooting,
they managed to hit something!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.860
I'll put us down
on some land close to us.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.900
Propulsion system control.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.450
Disengaged.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.490
Separation bolt.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.570
Arming.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.330
Separation!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.960
Separation light, green!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.180
Continue pitch up.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.640
Flight module, confirmed.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.980
Docking procedure, start.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.190
Roll, pitch, and yaw,
dead on target.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.730
Docking in seven...

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:48.760
Six...

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.740
Five...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.650
Four...

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:50.990
Three...

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:52.780
Two...

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:53.410
One...

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.490
Capture!

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:57.190
Hull latch, engage.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.440
Lagu engine flight module,
docking completed.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.780
Emit Lagu energy.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.090
Yes.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:28.040
So, who are you, anyway?
Where are we going?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:32.870
C'mon, tell me! Are you
listening? Listen, you...!

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.040
You're a spy and you
carry a business card?!

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:47.450
And what is an "lnternational Crisis Management Treaty
Authority Organization, World Secret Agent League...

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:50.090
...Special Expeditionary Foreign
Affairs Division" anyway?!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.890
Wow, a class A agent, huh?

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:59.170
So, where are we going,
Miss Class A Agent Maypia?

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:01.570
To the Regulus' hangar bay.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.800
We may be able to lose the
guys after us and escape.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:08.440
Ooh, no wonder you're a class
A agent! You're so cool!

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.160
Be quiet and follow me,
or l'll leave you behind!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.160
Right, right.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.100
Aika!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:58.130
So, that's how
Gozo got hurt then?

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.840
There are all sorts of
rumors about that guy.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.180
He never talks about it.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.580
Nobody knows
the truth about him.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.400
Aika! Are you okay?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.030
Where's Rion?

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.950
Well, about that... Aika...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.000
Where is Rion?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:33.960
Where's Rion?!
What's happened to her?!

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:39.890
There was nothing I could do.
I only managed to rescue you.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.000
You left her behind!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:45.230
Aika!

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:50.980
What do you think
you're doing, Aika?!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.480
I have to save her! Rion...

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:58.200
Rion... I have to save her!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:01.490
Aika!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:06.080
You're still not back to full
strength. Don't push yourself.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:13.840
Rion... I have to save Rion...

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:16.660
Aika...

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.920
All right, we'll do it.
But first you have to recover.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.310
Of course! Food!
Let's have something to eat!

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.850
Cut it out, you old hag!
You're scaring the fish away!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.290
Cut the crap, Bandra!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.290
You're set on going back?

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:58.500
In the end, you're just
a little kid at heart.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:00.730
This "l've gotta save her" line.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.510
Just 'cuz you're hot for the girl!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.840
You're just dreaming!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.980
You're gonna die! Die!
You're just gonna die!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:12.730
Shut up! I don't care!
l'd rather die saving her!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:16.860
Oh, really? Oh, really?
Go on. Go on.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:21.910
Just one thing, though!
I am NOT going with you!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:27.410
Fine, don't come!
I won't LET you come!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.840
Fine! l'm outta here!

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:43.010
I see. I'll head
out there myself, then.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:48.430
Keep Aika from doing anything
crazy before I arrive, Bandra.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:51.900
You heard what your boss said!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:54.400
Data on the Lagu.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.720
I don't want to
owe you anything.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.950
Hmpf! I hate your style!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.360
Rion...

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.000
Big Brother...

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:45.650
I didn't want you to
see me fail like that...

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:49.080
Enough. Don't worry about it.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.730
I've a favor to ask of you.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:01.000
I made this based off
of the one that woman had.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.850
Your very own, personal
Ultranate metal.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.430
Several times more powerful
than the original.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.440
You'll wear it, won't you, Nena?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.770
Good girl.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.040
It suits you so well, Nena.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.660
Does it, Big Brother?

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.780
Nice, Nena...

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.860
Yes? Roger.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.300
Mr. Hargen, we have a message
in from the Naval Chief.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:50.720
Couldn't wait any longer, eh?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.970
I demand it once more.
Hand over the Lagu, Hargen.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.480
I'm afraid I can't.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.890
We're prepared to
use force, if necessary.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:01.900
As you wish.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:07.840
That material is too valuable
to give to stupid apes like you.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:10.660
I will put it to
much more effective use.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:13.540
Why, you...
You won't get away with...

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:18.710
I've no time to listen
to the chattering of apes.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.530
What's the matter?!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:29.510
After you set it to blow,
get out on your own. Good luck.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.890
Maypi...a?

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.070
Hey, wait!

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.360
C'mon, what's wrong?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.660
Wait! What's the big idea?!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.410
Cabin pressure!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.210
Auto!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.500
Oxygen regulator!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.210
Normal!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.080
Flood lights!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:56.790
On!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.540
Repressurization switch!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.040
Safe!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.970
Captain, Mr. Hargen's coming in.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:02.710
Right. Roger.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.760
Onboard speakers, on plus 2.

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:19.620
To all crew and tech staff.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:23.520
This ship is now moving into
the operation's final stage.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.150
After we reach
the stratosphere...

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.650
...we'll hit the Earth
with the Lagu Beam.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:32.970
However, this operation
will not result in destruction!

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:37.040
Lagu energy rolls back
the effects of entropy...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.740
...and will result in the
purification of the entire Earth!

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:43.590
I repeat, this operation
will destroy nothing!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.960
Since the dawn of time,
humanity has inflicted...

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.510
...great suffering
upon Mother Earth.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.260
We now perform a ceremony for
the atonement of all mankind!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.810
Catherine!

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:05.870
C'mon! Shake a leg!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:17.690
Would you get off of me?!

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.530
Well, you pulled me
down here, didn't you?

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.550
Glasses, glasses...
Where are my glasses...?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.710
This is the room from when we...!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.860
The Lagu reactor. This is
the ship's main power source.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:41.900
Eight ships sighted ahead of us!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:48.020
In formation, with a
heavy ship in the center!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.360
They've come.
Sound battle stations!

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.740
Lagu impingement shield, on!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:08.170
Ships sighted blocking our course.
I think it's the national fleet.

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:15.910
Take us in!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.850
Aye! Lagu engines,
ahead full!

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:29.270
Yikes! The output's rising!
How do I stop this thing?!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.520
Enemy ships have opened fire!

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:34.850
Evasive action!

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:38.280
It doesn't matter. I'll teach
those apes a lesson.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.240
Return fire!

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:45.090
Ready all guns! Target the central
ship of the formation ahead!

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.750
Plot firing solution!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.710
Enemy shots, impacting!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:55.930
Are they...?!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.920
They got us!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:58.890
Direct hit, forward deck!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.600
No damage.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.430
Enemy vessels,
firing second salvo!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.600
Ready main guns!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:05.940
Load main guns
with Lagu shells!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.850
Firing solution, input!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:23.450
Fire main guns!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.460
Impact in 24!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.790
Enemy shots, impacting!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:43.930
This is Maypia! What's with this
bombardment?! l'm still on board!

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.850
Maypia, this was
a political decision.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:52.440
Shit! They're abandoning me!

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.360
Direct hit, astern to port!
No damage!

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.970
Attention!
Our shots are impacting!

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:16.620
Main ship, vaporized.
#4 light ship, dead in the water.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:18.300
The remaining
vessels are retreating.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.720
It worked!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.010
We did it!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.860
There it is. So, what
are we supposed to do?

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:37.770
Take us in close.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.400
Don't blame me
if this doesn't work!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.530
All hands to stations!
Going to flight configuration!

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.540
Main wing, takeoff position!
Gear, down!

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:09.520
What's up with that?!
It just turned into a rocket!

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:11.730
You mean that thing can fly?!

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.200
Leak check. Cockpit pressure?

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:14.800
Auto.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:15.530
Cabin pressure?

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:15.980
Auto.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.770
Air data processors?

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:17.720
On.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.420
Anti-ice?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:18.900
On.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.300
Takeoff checklist, completed.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:26.080
Until we reach rotation speed,
engine failure will cancel takeoff.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:29.540
Any failures after that and we'll
perform an emergency landing.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:29.750
Right.

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.840
My control.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:34.750
Your control.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.700
Runway, clear!

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:39.970
Clear for takeoff!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.970
Holy Fox, launch!

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:48.160
Power set, takeoff position!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.770
Power, set!

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:59.280
All right, engine lamp, normal.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:06.730
Are they going to fly?

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:10.530
Hey, what do you mean, "fly"?
What's gonna fly?!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:17.950
C'mon, what did you do?
Tell me!

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:20.130
Up! Look up.

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.630
Engine bay doors, open!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:25.590
What?

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.470
If they stay open in a gravity
field, they'll be damaged!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.720
Shut them, quickly!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.130
I can't! The emergency system in
the engine bay has been activated!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.460
We can't override it from here!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:36.940
I'll go.

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:41.860
One aircraft,
approaching from astern!

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.770
Forget it! Let it go!

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:49.330
See you!

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:53.820
What do you mean, "see you"?!
What about me?!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:57.790
Sorry, but this is
only built for one.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.570
Too bad.

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:06.650
Why, you...! Hey!
Lemme go, you idiot!

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:08.680
Like hell l'll let go!

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:11.680
You...! You...! You...!

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.570
Maypia!

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:30.850
She's dead...

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:34.770
Well, serves her right!
Trying to escape by herself...

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:55.100
Okay, just let
us down like this.

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:16.200
Hurry up...

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:25.260
A-Aika...

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.550
AIKA!

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:33.700
Gusto!

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:34.890
Aika!

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:39.660
What are you doing?!
Get going! lt's closing!

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:41.400
We'll stay here!

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:57.060
VR!

00:23:57.740 --> 00:23:58.450
Rotation!

00:24:14.380 --> 00:24:16.600
No! Stop it! You pervert!

00:24:34.500 --> 00:24:36.630
Hey!

00:24:40.820 --> 00:24:43.790
What, you still alive, Gusto?

00:24:49.250 --> 00:24:50.540
This is...?!

00:24:56.500 --> 00:24:58.680
We meet again.

00:25:04.350 --> 00:25:06.360
Welcome back.

00:25:30.590 --> 00:25:34.680
Let's go out into the bustling city.

00:25:37.260 --> 00:25:45.020
I just want to slip off my boots and walk along with the wind.

00:25:46.230 --> 00:25:50.400
That feeling of honesty that I had forgotten...

00:25:52.780 --> 00:26:00.940
...is reawakened with just a single deep breath.

00:26:01.870 --> 00:26:05.830
As I sit by the window in the moonlight...

00:26:05.830 --> 00:26:10.710
...with my chin cupped in my hand...

00:26:10.710 --> 00:26:16.260
...I find myself thinking of you.

00:26:16.260 --> 00:26:24.890
Though I have kept it in my
heart for such a... such a long time...

00:26:24.890 --> 00:26:32.020
...without thinking, I look back at the person I used to be.

00:26:32.020 --> 00:26:39.950
I know, oh, I know.
It's because I'm much more naive than I look.

00:26:40.450 --> 00:26:50.420
Always wavering,
caught somewhere between cowardice and arrogance.

00:27:03.260 --> 00:27:11.770
Since those feelings are
growing stronger and stronger inside...

00:27:11.770 --> 00:27:18.950
...I gradually feel that there's a new tomorrow for me.

00:27:18.950 --> 00:27:23.370
Though I may hesitate, though I may dream...

00:27:23.370 --> 00:27:27.500
Though I may keep taking the long way around...

00:27:27.500 --> 00:27:31.420
...when I eventually reach that place...

00:27:31.420 --> 00:27:37.550
...I want to be met by your smiling face.

00:28:10.740 --> 00:28:13.590
Now that l've gotten back
on board Hargen's ship...

00:28:13.590 --> 00:28:16.880
...l see that Nena has been changed
by the power of the Ultranate metal.

00:28:17.210 --> 00:28:18.880
In the face of its
unstoppable attack...

00:28:19.080 --> 00:28:20.340
...my body can
only cry out in pain.

00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:23.680
What's wrong? You want
to throw your life away?

00:28:23.680 --> 00:28:27.530
Meanwhile, Hargen's terrifying
project begins to move...

00:28:27.530 --> 00:28:30.970
...with the aim of recreating the
greatest earthquake in history.

00:28:30.970 --> 00:28:35.480
We shall build an ideal
human civilization! A Utopia!

00:28:35.480 --> 00:28:38.740
Forget it! You can't
make me do what you want!

00:28:39.260 --> 00:28:43.020
Aika, next trial:
A flower blooming in space.

00:28:43.020 --> 00:28:45.810
A shining aurora leads
the way to destruction.
